# The Needs of the Many, cast as Bot2's Raging Goblin attacks, sacrificing the Ornithopter (CR 601.2b): the Memnite Bot1 still
# controls gains hexproof and indestructible, Bot1 gains hexproof - Bot2's Lightning Bolt can target neither (CR 702.11b-c) -
# and the Goblin's combat damage to Bot1 is prevented (CR 615.1). The spell is exiled as it resolves (CR 608.2c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Memnite
The Needs of the Many
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Raging Goblin
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Raging Goblin.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Raging Goblin > Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Needs of the Many.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Hexproof; Indestructible
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Memnite)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Exile = The Needs of the Many
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Hexproof; Indestructible
